# Build context for the backend image is the repo root. Keep secrets, local
# environments and large/private folders out of it (the image downloads its
# weights from Hugging Face; it never needs these).
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv
**/venv
**/venv-*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/db.sqlite3
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
.git
data
models
submission
results
